  "Remove stale snapshots?": ["Siba amakuru yabitswe ashaje?","Supprimer les instantanés obsolètes ?","Futa picha za data zilizopitwa na wakati?"],
  "Snapshots are signed and compressed; they are relayed through the cloud and can be inspected only by authorized admin sessions.": ["Amakuru yabitswe asinywe kandi agabanyijwe ingano; anyuzwa muri cloud kandi arebwa gusa n'abayobozi babifitiye uburenganzira.","Les instantanés sont signés et compressés ; ils transitent par le cloud et ne sont consultables que par les sessions admin autorisées.","Picha za data zimesainiwa na kubanwa; hupitishwa kwenye wingu na zinaweza kuchunguzwa na wasimamizi walioidhinishwa pekee."],
  "Snapshots not refreshed for 14+ days are deleted. Active devices re-upload fresh ones on their next sync.": ["Amakuru yabitswe atavuguruwe mu minsi 14+ arasibwa. Ibikoresho bikora bizongera kuyohereza kuri sync ikurikira.","Les instantanés non actualisés depuis plus de 14 jours sont supprimés. Les appareils actifs en renverront lors de leur prochaine synchronisation.","Picha za data ambazo hazijasasishwa kwa siku 14+ hufutwa. Vifaa vinavyotumika vitapakia upya kwenye usawazishaji unaofuata."],
  "Each claim gets a signed BB3 unlock code and its shop is extended. Only do this after confirming every transaction in your MoMo/Airtel statement.": ["Buri busabe buhabwa kode ya BB3 isinywe kandi igihe cy'uruhushya kikongerwa. Banza ugenzure buri transaction kuri MoMo/Airtel mbere yo kwemeza.","Chaque demande reçoit un code BB3 signé et la licence de la boutique est prolongée. Vérifiez chaque transaction sur votre relevé MoMo/Airtel avant d’approuver.","Kila dai hupata msimbo wa BB3 uliotiwa saini na leseni ya duka huongezwa. Hakiki kila muamala kwenye taarifa ya MoMo/Airtel kabla ya kuidhinisha."],
  "Delete this payment claim?": ["Siba ubu busabe bw'ubwishyu?","Supprimer cette demande de paiement ?","Futa dai hili la malipo?"],
  "This removes the claim from the queue permanently. Issued codes are not affected.": ["Ibi bikura burundu ubusabe mu rutonde. Kode zatanzwe ntizihinduka.","Cette action supprime définitivement la demande de la file. Les codes émis ne sont pas affectés.","Hii huondoa dai kwenye foleni kabisa. Misimbo iliyotolewa haiathiriwi."],
  "Reject payment claim": ["Anga ubusabe bw'ubwishyu","Rejeter la demande de paiement","Kataa dai la malipo"],
  "The owner sees this reason in the app and on the website.": ["Nyir'iduka abona iyi mpamvu muri app no ku rubuga.","Le propriétaire voit ce motif dans l’application et sur le site.","Mmiliki ataona sababu hii kwenye programu na tovuti."],
  "MoMo transaction could not be confirmed": ["Ihererekanya rya MoMo ntiryashoboye kugenzurwa","La transaction MoMo n’a pas pu être confirmée","Muamala wa MoMo haukuweza kuthibitishwa"],
  "The app unlocks automatically on its next sync — no code needed.": ["App izafungura iduka kuri sync ikurikira — nta kode ikenewe.","La boutique sera déverrouillée à la prochaine synchronisation — aucun code requis.","Programu itafungua duka kwenye usawazishaji unaofuata — hakuna msimbo unaohitajika."],
