  "but it doesn't have admin rights yet. The master admin can grant access from Admin team.": ["ariko ntirabona uburenganzira bw'ubuyobozi. Umuyobozi mukuru ashobora kubutanga muri Admin team.", "mais ce compte ne dispose pas encore des droits admin. Le super administrateur peut les accorder dans l’équipe admin.", "lakini bado haina ruhusa za usimamizi. Msimamizi mkuu anaweza kutoa ruhusa kupitia timu ya wasimamizi."],
