  "After paying, copy the successful payment SMS from your phone's Messages app and paste its full text here. No screenshot is required. Never include your mobile money PIN.": ["Umaze kwishyura, koporora SMS yemeza ubwishyu muri Messages za telefone uyishyire hano yose. Nta foto ya screen ikenewe. Ntuzigere ushyiramo PIN ya Mobile Money.", "Après le paiement, copiez le SMS de confirmation depuis l’application Messages de votre téléphone et collez-le ici en entier. Aucune capture d’écran n’est nécessaire. N’incluez jamais votre code PIN Mobile Money.", "Baada ya kulipa, nakili SMS ya uthibitisho wa malipo kutoka kwenye Messages za simu na ubandike maandishi yote hapa. Picha ya skrini haihitajiki. Usiweke kamwe PIN yako ya Mobile Money."],
